# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"
msgstr "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Congratulations on completing the \"Basics of Quantum Information\" course by IBM! Please take a moment to help us improve our course by filling out the following [quick survey](https://your.feedback.ibm.com/jfe/form/SV_9WuCWHSXP8rXo7Y). Your feedback will be used to enhance our content offering and user experience. Thank you!\n"
msgstr "Binabati kita sa pagkumpleto ng kursong \"Basics of Quantum Information\" ng IBM! Mangyaring maglaan ng sandali para tulungan kaming pahusayin ang aming kurso sa pamamagitan ng pagsagot sa sumusunod na [maikling survey](https://your.feedback.ibm.com/jfe/form/SV_9WuCWHSXP8rXo7Y). Gagamitin ang iyong feedback para pahusayin ang aming content offering at user experience. Salamat!\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Subukan ang iyong kaalaman {#test-your-knowledge}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button below to navigate to IBM&reg; Training, where you can take the badging exam for Basics of quantum information.\n"
msgstr "Pagkatapos makumpleto ang mga pagbabasa at aktibidad sa kursong ito, i-click ang button sa ibaba para pumunta sa IBM&reg; Training, kung saan maaari kang kumuha ng badging exam para sa Basics of quantum information.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be sent to the email you used to register with IBM&reg; Training.\n"
msgstr "Ang pagsusulit ay binubuo ng 20 tanong, at kailangan mong sagutin nang tama ang hindi bababa sa 16 para makapasa. Kapag nakapasa ka, awtomatikong ipapadala ang iyong badge sa email na ginamit mo sa pagpaparehistro sa IBM&reg; Training.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr "Tiyaking handa ka na bago kumuha ng pagsusulit. Kung hindi ka makapasa sa dalawang pagtatangka, pansamantalang mala-lock ang pagsusulit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notice: These exams on the IBM Training site may be temporarily unavailable in the next few days, due to maintenance.\n"
msgstr "Paunawa: Ang mga pagsusulit na ito sa IBM Training site ay maaaring pansamantalang hindi available sa susunod na ilang araw, dahil sa maintenance.\n"

